"c":"OTEX 2019 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"Adjusted EBITDA margin was 36.4%, an increase of 320 basis points compared to 33.2% in the prior fiscal year and driven by our deep operating lens into the business as well as the restructuring activities we first announced in our Q1 call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/open-text-corp-otex-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2019 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"Just look at the U.S. news today on another 10% China tariff and the hard Brexit discussions last week in England.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2019 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"Our growth would have been even higher, if not for the short-term, external effects of a strong U.S. dollar, trade wars, tariffs and the temporary slowdown across Asia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2019 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"It is now a cloud first world and OpenText is in marquee position to be a strategic provider of cloud platform that provides for an information advantage, not just cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2019 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"And that does lead into kind of the corporate psyche and impacting, do I want to spend money for growth or do I want to do more cost out strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"So, the reaction has been very favorable, actually that it's not just the price increase, but we're finding new capabilities and services for those additional charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Thanos Moschopoulos","x":"And then finally, you started implementing the significant maintenance price increase, several months ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"And let me outline the reasons; first of all, higher revenues this quarter, and second, lower depreciation and completion of the required amortization period of certain technology assets for accounting purposes, and restructuring charges, as well as higher interest income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"Migrating to the cloud is not about cost out, right it's about your next platform is about innovation, agility, speed, modernizing the platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2020-01-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"The business is benefiting from the structural changes in global trade, increased in changing tariffs, privacy, compliance and ethical trade.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/open-text-corp-otex-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2020-01-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"Global recession concerns, trade and tariff floors, Europe, US -- and US manufacturing slowed down, the Coronavirus as well as the Gulf nations and the pending Brexit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/open-text-corp-otex-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"Carbonite integration and restructuring plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/open-text-corp-otex-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"Today we are announcing a restructuring plan that integrates Carbonite into OpenText and also into streamlining operations at OpenText.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/open-text-corp-otex-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2020-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"Stellar customer experiences overall and especially with contactless retail, direct-to-consumer accelerate even faster, and finally, the need for digital agile and rapidly adaptable supply chain platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/open-text-corp-otex-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"To that end, we are announcing today a set of cost control measures and a restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/open-text-corp-otex-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"The cost control programs are temporary while the pandemic persists the restructuring programs are permanent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/open-text-corp-otex-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"In digital experience, the shift to supporting a customer through their entire life cycle, via an omnichannel delivery digital delivery, direct-to-consumer and contactless experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"Second is in the world of contactless and direct-to-consumer we've seen a real strong interest in our digital experience platform, which was another place of strength for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2020-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"They are right in the core of our wheelhouse of content services, plus our technologies of work from anywhere and customer experiences and our customer experience platform, supporting direct-to-consumer and contactless activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"Rapid Radiology, one of the largest teleradiology providers in the U.S. They selected OpenText business network, to streamline the delivery of radiology test results to electronic medical records.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2020 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"GAAP net income was $26.4 million in Q4, down 63.3% and primarily due to $47 million of intangible amortization from Carbonite and $74 million of special charges relating to our recent restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/open-text-corp-otex-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"There will be many structural and long-lasting changes due to the change in human behaviors, including work from anywhere, direct-to-consumer commerce, contactless experiences and payments, extreme customer experience expectations in new supply chains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"The OpenText Experience Cloud business is benefiting from the trends to all things contactless, the direct-to-consumer explosion and all the associated technologies that enable omnichannel and social commerce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"Our fiscal '21 target model fully reflects the savings from previously announced restructuring, the compensation restorations, Mark referred to in his commentary, and our fiscal '21 hiring plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"If you look at our adjusted EBITDA, 42.6% are relentless focus on fact, rapid integration, taking the cost out where we think we should, integration of the cloud teams, integration of engineering teams, Carbonite contributed as well to such stellar adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"We are increasing our outlook for the year on cloud as we do highlight it from low double digit to mid-double digit, customer support from constant to low single-digit, ARR from mid-single digit to high single digit, but we're also still looking at cloud and PS at the same levels we talked about…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2020-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"But the vast majority of our business network has, and that's translated into an updated and increased outlook for the year, among other things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/open-text-corp-otex-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2021-02-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"Our first half of the fiscal year performance has been strong, particularly in the context of the global pandemic and we're very pleased to increase our outlook for the remainder of the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/05/open-text-corp-otex-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2021-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"OpenText is in the early days of helping customers evolve and transform the supply chains to become more real-time, more local and more sustainable while simultaneously remaining compliant with global tax and tariff regulations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/open-text-corporation-otex-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"OTEX 2021 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Frank Joseph Surace","x":"I wanted to take a bit deeper into the raised guidance for cloud.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/open-text-corporation-otex-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Barrenechea","x":"To the OpenText Business Network Cloud, notable customer wins included JCB, a Tokyo-based global payment company who selected our business network managed services to streamline processing and payment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/open-text-corporation-otex-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q1","e":"otex","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"GAAP net income was $131.9 million, up compared to net income of $102.4 million in the prior year and reflecting lower amortization cost and COVID-related restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/open-text-corporation-otex-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2022-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Madhu Ranganathan","x":"And number two, as you outlined, yes, we did have some salary forbearance and consideration, but more importantly, they did pass through two merit increases, and we're investing in talent overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/04/open-text-otex-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2022-08-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"Where possible, we minimize our FX exposure through natural hedging where we match revenues and costs in our major theaters of operations, and we'll continue to optimize this balance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/open-text-otex-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2022-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"We raised prices by 5% starting July 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/open-text-otex-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2022 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"We're also accelerating some key automation projects for efficiency and cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/open-text-otex-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2023 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2023-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Treiber","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/open-text-otex-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2023 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2023-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"We also intend to fix the things that need fixing, accelerate to the cloud, reinvention of the customer engagement with the OpenText love model, centralizing renewals and implementing OT best practices, and rightsizing the organization for speed, impact, and growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/open-text-otex-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2023 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2023-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrenechea","x":"On our cost-reduction programs, we confirm our approach to removing 400 million of combined company costs over the next 18 months, by reducing overlapping work, removing inefficiencies, eliminating redundant facilities, and automating work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/open-text-otex-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"Our robust cash flow engine provides us with the scale and flexibility to continue investing for growth within our core enterprise information for AI market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/opentext-otex-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tom Jenkins","x":"We've set a cadence of one divestiture per quarter, and we're working towards streamlining our portfolio to get to our core business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/opentext-otex-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"George Michael Kurosawa","x":"You maintained the full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/opentext-otex-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q2","e":"otex","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Richard Tse","x":"Tom, you sort of touched on this a little bit, but in light of the events over the past few weeks in software around all the philanthropic news, given where you sit and sort of your background, can you maybe elaborate a little bit in terms of why AI cannot disrupt OpenText and content management?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/opentext-otex-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ayman Antoun","x":"When we consistently partner with clients to solve their most pressing challenges and realize the full value of their AI investment, they reward us with growth, loyalty, and value creation for our shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/open-text-otex-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"I mean, we've continued to do a lot of work on the cost savings and business optimizations that we've got at play, and we're starting to see the benefits come through from that, both in terms of our OpEx profile, as well as naturally, into cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/open-text-otex-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"In addition, we are also increasing our outlook range for free cash flow growth from 17% to 20% to 22% to 25% year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/open-text-otex-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"Just to kind of complete the picture, I mean, obviously we've increased our guide on bookings, which is largely on the back of the Content business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/open-text-otex-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q3","e":"otex","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Tom Jenkins","x":"The comment about the buying market is simply that the SaaSpocalypse thing didn't really affect serious buyers because they were doing this on a discounted cash flow basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/open-text-otex-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ayman Antoun","x":"Next, to continue the momentum of growth, we will be shifting more of our R&D investment into our core portfolio, cloud capabilities and AI offerings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/open-text-otex-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OTEX 2026 Q4","e":"otex","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"As Ayman mentioned earlier, we are taking early actions to drive growth, and this includes increasing sales capacity, investing in our partner ecosystem to expand market reach and shifting more R&D investment into our core portfolio, cloud capabilities and AI offerings.","url